      }},
      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A total of 1,265 patients with age-related diseases such as diabetes, arthritis, vascular disease and hypertension as well as 1,100 persons in diminished health without apparent disease, were treated with the metal chelator EDTA and antioxidants such as vitamin C, E, beta-carotene, selenium, zinc and chromium. Good results were observed in the majority of patients. This is encouraging for the initiation of controlled clinical trials."},
